#ASSERT `Until what day are my weekly payments as a surviving partner paid` (`dt` 1 3 2026) (`dt` 1 1 2040) FALSE (`dt` 1 1 2000) EQUALS `dt` 1 3 2031
#ASSERT `Until what day are my weekly payments as a surviving partner paid` (`dt` 1 3 2026) (`dt` 1 7 2028) FALSE (`dt` 1 1 2000) EQUALS `dt` 1 7 2028
-- A dependent child until 15 June 2035: to 14 June 2035.
#ASSERT `Until what day are my weekly payments as a surviving partner paid` (`dt` 1 3 2026) (`dt` 1 1 2040) TRUE (`dt` 15 6 2035) EQUALS `dt` 14 6 2035

GIVEN `other` IS A `The child's other parent`, `later` IS A BOOLEAN, `paid` IS A BOOLEAN, `dep` IS A BOOLEAN, `dam` IS A BOOLEAN, `conv` IS A BOOLEAN, `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
`child weekly` `other` `later` `paid` `dep` `dam` `conv` `the day` MEANS
    `How much is the child's weekly payment under s 59` `other` `later` `paid` `dep` `dam` `conv` `the day` (`dt` 1 1 2015) 100

