#ASSERT `child weekly` `no other parent` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (`dt` 1 1 2033) EQUALS 0
-- s 59(1)(b): the other parent is a dependent partner who supports the child: none of (i)-(iii): nil.
